### FULL CHALLAN LIFECYCLE TEST — Run in order

### Step 1: Login as Sales to get token
POST http://localhost:5000/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "sales@demo.com",
  "password": "Passw0rd!"
}

###

### Step 2: Create DRAFT Challan
POST http://localhost:5000/api/v1/challans
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "<CUSTOMER_ID>",
  "status": "DRAFT",
  "items": [
    { "productId": "<PRODUCT_ID_1>", "quantity": 3 },
    { "productId": "<PRODUCT_ID_2>", "quantity": 2 }
  ]
}

###

### Step 3: List All Challans
GET http://localhost:5000/api/v1/challans?page=1&limit=10&status=DRAFT
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

###

### Step 4: Get Challan Detail
GET http://localhost:5000/api/v1/challans/<CHALLAN_ID>
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

###

### Step 5: Update Draft Challan (change items)
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/v1/challans/<CHALLAN_ID>
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    { "productId": "<PRODUCT_ID_1>", "quantity": 5 }
  ]
}

###

### Step 6: Confirm Challan (triggers stock deduction)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/v1/challans/<CHALLAN_ID>/confirm
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

###

### Step 7: Attempt Edit on Confirmed Challan — expect 409 CHALLAN_NOT_EDITABLE
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/v1/challans/<CHALLAN_ID>
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    { "productId": "<PRODUCT_ID_1>", "quantity": 1 }
  ]
}

###

### Step 8: Cancel Confirmed Challan (reverses stock)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/v1/challans/<CHALLAN_ID>/cancel
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

###

### Step 9: Verify Stock Restored — check product detail
GET http://localhost:5000/api/v1/products/<PRODUCT_ID_1>
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>

###

### Step 10: Test Insufficient Stock — confirm challan with quantity > available stock
POST http://localhost:5000/api/v1/challans
Authorization: Bearer <TOKEN>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "<CUSTOMER_ID>",
  "status": "CONFIRMED",
  "items": [
    { "productId": "<LOW_STOCK_PRODUCT_ID>", "quantity": 9999 }
  ]
}
